# Archon of the Wild Rose only helps "creatures you control that are enchanted by Auras you control". Bot2's Pacifism on Bot1's
# Memnite is not an Aura Bot1 controls, so the Memnite stays a 1/1 with no flying; Bot1's Pacifism on Bot2's Ornithopter is an Aura
# Bot1 controls but the Ornithopter is not a creature Bot1 controls, so it stays a 0/2. The Archon itself, enchanted by Bot1's own
# Pacifism, stays the 4/4 it is (it is not one of the "other" creatures).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Memnite
Archon of the Wild Rose
Pacifism
Pacifism
Plains
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Pacifism
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Plains x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Archon of the Wild Rose.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Pacifism.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Toughness = 1
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pacifism.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pacifism.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Archon of the Wild Rose)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Archon of the Wild Rose.Power = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Archon of the Wild Rose.Toughness = 4
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
